  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Multiannual operational programme estimate - Support to ONAO IV</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;This multiannual operational programme estimate covers the entire operational implementation period of the financing agreement for &#xAB; &#xBB;Support to the Office of the NAO IV  Nigeria, CRIS number: 2015 / 038-373 financed under 11thEuropean Development Fund (EDF). Its overall objective is to support the Government of Nigeria in achieving its growth and poverty reduction policies through the implementation of the National Indicative Programme (NIP) for the period 2014-2020.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
